OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early morning mist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches lifting with another primarily
OL,7,Fsunny day with just some patchy cloud.
OL,8,FA brisker easterly breeze than on
OL,9,FMonday, giving a somewhat fresher feel
OL,10,Fon some coasts. Becoming very warm by
OL,11,Fthe afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,14,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,15,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,16,FStaying rather warm in urban areas but
OL,17,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
